{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1076899-bulwarks-to-bargains-how-would-you-do-it","id":1076899,"title":"Bulwarks to Bargains: How would you do it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-12T04:19:06-07:00","id":1076899,"title":"Bulwarks to Bargains: How would you do it?","content":"Now, without the book and full context, its impossible to say how the Court systems will now be organized, or if its all going to be the same and Bargains is just the Seasonal Bulwark, etc. However, for the sake of just having some fun theory crafting and guessing, lets pretend for a moment. Imagine that Courts don't run on stories anymore, but on Bargains. To have a Court, you have to track down some aspect of Ironside and strike a deal with it.<br /> <br /> Clearly, the Seasonals have struck a pact with the four seasons. As well, the Directional Courts and Seelie Courts have struck deals with the points of the compass and the time of day (or, perhaps, celestial bodies like sun and moon). <br /> <br /> Now, Rose has said that all the previous Courts are still possible to play under the new system. Since we're pretending that all Courts run off Bargains now, lets mess around with the old proposed Courts and figure out how we want these Bargains to work.<br /> <br /> <br /> Scheherazade's Toronto Freehold<br /> Honshu's Moon Princess Freehold<br /> The Rose Courts of Paris<br /> The Online Courts (changelings that communicate by online mediums)<br /> Hrmm.... I can't remember any other proposals offhand. <br /> <br /> So, how would you take some of these old ones and make new Bargains for them to work pretty close to the same way as they did under a Bulwark system? Do people have any ideas for new Courts using Bargains?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T06:58:02-07:00","id":1076943,"title":"","content":"The Online Courts, I don't remember online courts.<br /> <br /> The easiest would be Toronto, because the names of the courts are based on concete stuff. So the Court of Ivory would make a Bargain with Ivory (although the Myth might he that Mitra made the Bargain with Ivory), The Silver Courts made a deal with Silver (this would not make them popular with Werewolves), Ruby Court makes a Bargain with Ruby, Jade Court makes a Bargain with Jade, and Brass Court makes a deal with Brass. I don't know how none Seasonal Courts deal with Bargains so I don't know what actual form they will take.<br /> <br /> Honshue, maybe it will be deals with Rats, Bowls, and Dragons?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}